From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 10:46:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 024/119] feat: Mask Rotation - turn the bokeh shape mask
 independently of the iris phase

New Lens property Mask Rotation (deg) -> Dof_User_MaskRotation (radians). The mask is its own optical element, so it rotates separately from Blade Rotation: the gather taps are rotated forward on the CPU and the splat pixel shader samples the texture through the inverse rotation (vDofBokehMask2 = cos/sin), so the soft halo and the sharp silhouette turn together. Saved/restored with the other DOF params; docs updated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017nykaDjTHxHDSo11CsYx6M
